ally from her  interview she just said that that is her  role her role is to protect brand period  she doesn't tell him what to do she  doesn't try to influence his decision  she just protects him so it looks like  she will get him back to Winterfell and  this is where we might see Howland Reed  come back into the picture especially if  she decides to head back to visit the  crannogmen as mentioned wolf hill quarry  the battle there will probably be the  equivalent of the epic nine episode that  we have any other you know seasons  basically the ninth episode is the one  where everything goes down but Season  seven only has seven episodes so this  will actually happen in episode six from  what we know about the directors we know  that the wolf hill quarry battle will  take place in that episode and I will  tell you all about that in my king in  the North video about Jon Snow and  lastly we did get  one more bit of news about a stark and  that's uncle Benjen who has been seen on  set around that Wolf Hill quarry  shooting location so that's gonna be it  that's pretty much everything we can  talk about without totally getting into  the John video so I'll be doing that one  in the series probably next I have I  think four more that we need to go over  so his is coming up make sure you check  back for that if you have any questions  about any of the stark storylines or  anything else going on the north make  sure you leave a comment and I'll try to  respond please like the video if you  found it interesting and be sure to  subscribe so you can enter the book  giveaway that is still going on all you  have to do is be a subscriber leave a  comment on this video and when I reach  twenty eight thousand subscribers I'll  pick one of the comments on one of the  videos for this giveaway and I'll send  that lucky commenter a copy of the 20th  anniversary of a game of Thrones  illustrated edition by george RR martin  there'll be a link in the description  where you can check it o